Show this credit, with both links, on every screen, page or view that uses
the data:

  Data: Post-Quantum Blockchains
  (https://balance0014.github.io/post-quantum-blockchains/),
  by Balance Zhao (https://x.com/balance0014)

A credit that appears only in a footer, an "about" page or the source code
does not meet this condition. The official badge and card (see "Embeds" on
the website's data page) carry the credit for you.

Additional permission: commercial use
-------------------------------------
As an additional permission beyond CC BY-NC 4.0, Balance Zhao permits
commercial use of the data, charts and text, free of charge, on three
conditions:

  1. Every screen, page or view that shows the data displays the credit
     above with both links, or shows the official badge or card.
  2. The date the data was checked is shown, and the copy you show is
     updated from this repository or website at least once a week.
  3. The use is registered by opening a "Used by" issue at
     https://github.com/Balance0014/post-quantum-blockchains/issues/new?template=used-by.yml

If you cannot meet these conditions, ask for permission in a GitHub issue
at https://github.com/Balance0014/post-quantum-blockchains/issues. Without
the conditions met or a separate permission, commercial use is not licensed.

